  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The School of Advanced International and Political Studies (HEIP) is a private higher education institution founded in 1899. The name HEIP stands for Hautes Études Internationales et Politiques. It is renowned for specialising in international relations, political science, and global affairs.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>With a diverse student body from all corners of the globe, you’ll find yourself in a multicultural environment at HEIP. The institution also hosts numerous events, conferences, and networking opportunities with professionals. Plus, you can also benefit from personalised support services such as academic counselling, career coaching, and mental health support.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>HEIP does not provide on-campus housing. However, it offers housing support to assist you in securing suitable accommodation near the campus. The institution collaborates with housing providers and platforms that list numerous rental offers, flatshares, and student halls.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
